      "passport": {
        "label": "Slave Market",
        "icon": "slave_market",
        "description": "This is where slaves are bought and sold. \n\nThere are many ways to become a slave in the Patriarchy.\nBorn into it. Sold for debt. Sold by parents. Condemned as punishment. Taken in war. Stolen from a distant village.\n\nThe market reeks of unwashed bodies and misery.\n\n\nSlaves are registered and taxed by the Patriarchy. If too many go missing, someone will come asking questions.",
